title: Panel Configuration
views:
  - title: Actions
    path: actions
    icon: mdi:tablet-dashboard
    cards:
      - type: markdown
        title: "Panel configuration"
        content: >-
          Change the nine labels below directly. To change what a button does,
          open **Settings → Automations & scenes → Scripts** and edit the
          matching **Panel action 1–9** script.

      - type: entities
        title: "Button labels"
        icon: mdi:form-textbox
        show_header_toggle: false
        entities:
          - input_text.panel_action_1_label
          - input_text.panel_action_2_label
          - input_text.panel_action_3_label
          - input_text.panel_action_4_label
          - input_text.panel_action_5_label
          - input_text.panel_action_6_label
          - input_text.panel_action_7_label
          - input_text.panel_action_8_label
          - input_text.panel_action_9_label

      - type: entities
        title: "Button actions"
        icon: mdi:gesture-tap-button
        show_header_toggle: false
        entities:
          - script.panel_action_1
          - script.panel_action_2
          - script.panel_action_3
          - script.panel_action_4
          - script.panel_action_5
          - script.panel_action_6
          - script.panel_action_7
          - script.panel_action_8
          - script.panel_action_9

  - title: Media
    path: media
    icon: mdi:music-box-multiple
    cards:
      - type: markdown
        title: "Sonos favourite order"
        content: >-
          New favourites appear first automatically. To pin favourites in a
          particular order, enter their names below separated by `|`, for
          example `Starry Nights Radio|Radio 1`. Any names not listed are
          appended newest-first. Names must match Sonos exactly.

      - type: entities
        title: "CrowPanel media"
        icon: mdi:playlist-star
        show_header_toggle: false
        entities:
          - input_text.panel_sonos_favorite_order
          - sensor.panel_sonos_favorites
